{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～好冷！已经到需要穿大衣的季节了。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1549", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“时间过得真快呢。１１月已经过一半了。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾差不多也该交个能互相取暖的可爱女朋友了吧？”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1550", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行啦，你们两个。我不准学生之间有那种不知羞耻的行为！”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": "_mc0467", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，如果对象的女性有相应的年龄，那也……不是不能容许。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": "_mc0468", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇～好积极。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1551", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到底从哪里来了，突然就出现……”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说安洁也是神出鬼没的。……新吾，怎么办，那个。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1552", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“用不会得罪人的回答来应对吧。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，新吾拜托你了。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1553", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果我们能温暖像老师这样优秀的女性，那冬天也不会觉得寒冷了。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊，新吾君。可以喔，不用客气可以喔！”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": "_mc0469", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那算什么不会得罪人的回答啊你。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1554", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她的眼神好闪亮。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，不愧是新吾同学呢。用那种方式引诱世间的妇女走岔路吗？”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "_ag3846", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎样都可以，但你是从哪里冒出来的啊。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "_ar6301", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿咻。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": "_sk5165", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊！？吓死我了，连樱乃都这样！”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "_ar6302", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“从地板长出来的。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": "_sk5166", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“地板！？居然有安洁不知道的捷径存在！”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "_ag3847", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拜托你们普通一点登场啦。不用从天花板和地板没关系……”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "_ar6303", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪的班级，不管什么时候来都很热闹呢。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "_mu2882", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“各务台的男生们来了之后就总是这样。唉，好怀念以前的女子学校生活……”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2659", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，有男生在果然不同呢。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "_mu2883", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么不同？”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2660", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“班上的气氛，学校整体的空气都改变了。小纱凪不这么觉得吗？”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "_mu2884", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个……”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2661", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然夺走我们两人的心，真是罪恶的女性呢。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1555", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么那样，我没办法在你们之间做出选择啦……”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": "_mc0470", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，这种时候该怎么办……不，不能欺瞒可爱的学生喔，万智。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": "_mc0471", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是但是，怎么能只选一个人……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": "_mc0472", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾，可以逃了吗？”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1556", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你为什么要说那种火上浇油的话？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没啊，刚才的气氛就是不得不那样说嘛。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1557", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“眼神真的好闪亮。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很亮呢。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1558", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……男人烂透了。”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2662", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼。被新吾君说那种话，心跳会加速呢。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "_mu2885", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是嘛？我只觉得恶心而已。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2663", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我像往常那样前往社团教室，途中看到了纱凪。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……纱凪啊。我到现在还不知道怎么跟她相处。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我得尽快习惯才行。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪同学。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你在挑衅我吗？”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2664", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不是！纱凪，是纱凪才对。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不准再犯。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2665", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然是同学，但还是很难习惯直接叫名字。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你要去社团吗？”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，是没错……”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2666", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她没有多说什么，然后低头看着地上。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你在找什么吗？”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟你没有关系。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2667", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是如果在找东西的话，多个人一起找比较快喔。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“与其让你帮忙，我宁可直接放弃。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn2668", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
